| `add_schematic_symbol` | `symbol_lib="Regulator_Linear"`, `symbol_name="L7805"`, `pos_x=150`, `pos_y=110`, `reference="U1"`, `value="L7805"`, `rotation=270`, `mirror=None` | Places the regulator at the centre, rotated so IN points up. |
