| `add_schematic_symbol` | `symbol_lib="Regulator_Linear"`, `symbol_name="AMS1117-5.0"`, `pos_x=150`, `pos_y=84`, `reference="U2"`, `value="AMS1117-5.0"`, `rotation=180`, `mirror=None` | LDO below the regulator, VO facing left. |
| `add_schematic_symbol` | `symbol_lib="power"`, `symbol_name="VCC"`, `pos_x=150`, `pos_y=152`, `reference="#PWR_VCC"`, `value="VCC"`, `rotation=0`, `mirror=None` | Provides VCC to U1. |
| `add_schematic_symbol` | `symbol_lib="power"`, `symbol_name="GND"`, `pos_x=150`, `pos_y=62`, `reference="#PWR_GND"`, `value="GND"`, `rotation=0`, `mirror=None` | Common ground. |
| `add_label` | `label_pos=[158, 86]`, `label_text="CH340C_VIN"`, `label_ref="CH340C_VIN_0"`, `label_type="input"`, `text_orient="right"` | Near U2 VO wire. |
| `connect_pins` | `"#PWR_VCC", "VCC", "U1", "IN"` | Connects VCC to regulator input. |
| `connect_pins` | `"#PWR_GND", "GND", "U1", "GND"` | Common ground. |
| `connect_pins` | `"U1", "OUT", "U2", "VO"` | Regulator output to LDO input. |
| `connect_pins` | `"U2", "GND", "#PWR_GND", "1"` | LDO ground to power GND. |
| `connect_pins` | `"U2", "VO", "IC1", "V3"` | LDO output to CH340C V3. |
| `connect_pins` | `"IC1", "GND", "#PWR_GND", "1"` | CH340C ground to power GND. |
| `write_out_all_wires()` | – | Finalises the schematic. |

